NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000738 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000739 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000740 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000741 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000742 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000743 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000744 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000745 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000746 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000747 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000748 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000749 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000750 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000751 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000752 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000753 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000754 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
